{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1794232615","published":"2026-11-09T13:57:09Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:28:39.761209280Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-14668","CVE-2026-14679","CVE-2026-2006","CVE-2026-6464"],"summary":"postgresql: Fix of 4 CVEs","details":"- CVE-2026-14668: make scalarineqsel() verify that a constant it expects to be\n  of type tid actually is\n- CVE-2026-14679: enforce the aggregate argument limit and protect fixed-size\n  FUNC_MAX_ARGS arrays\n- CVE-2026-6464: teach psql to skip in-line data after a COPY ... FROM STDIN\n  that fails before PGRES_COPY_IN, so the data is no longer executed as SQL;\n  such in-line data must now always be terminated by \\.\n- CVE-2026-2006: make the multibyte-to-wchar conversion of every encoding drop\n  an incomplete trailing character, as UTF-8 already did (completes the vendor\n  fix for CVE-2026-2006)\n- pgoutput: report an error instead of crashing the walsender when the\n  proto_version or publication_names option has no value (hardening, no CVE)","affected":[{"package":{"name":"postgresql","ecosystem":"TuxCare:RHEL:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/postgresql?distro=rhel-8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"13.23-3.module_el8+2778+8e5fd2e3.tuxcare.els7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/rhel8els/CLSA-2026-1794232615.json"}},{"package":{"name":"postgresql-contrib","ecosystem":"TuxCare:RHEL:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/postgresql-contrib?distro=rhel-8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"13.23-3.module_el8+2778+8e5fd2e3.tuxcare.els7"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/rhel8els/CLSA-2026-1794232615.json"}},{"package":{"name":"postgresql-docs","ecosystem":"TuxCare:RHEL:8","purl":"pkg:rpm/tuxcare/postgresql-docs?distro=rhel-8"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"13.23-3.module_el8+2778+8e5fd2